{"seq":2,"slug":"infrastructure-abstraction","title":"基础设施抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/infrastructure-abstraction","wordCount":817,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"基础设施抽象\">基础设施抽象</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基础设施抽象是平台工程的技术基石。它在底层云资源（AWS/GCP/Azure 的原生 API）和上层开发者之间构建一个语义化的中间层，让开发者以业务语义描述需求（&quot;我需要一个 PostgreSQL 数据库&quot;），而非操作云资源的底层细节（VPC、子网、安全组、实例类型等）。</p>\n<p>抽象的核心价值在于关注点分离：开发者关注&quot;要什么&quot;，平台团队关注&quot;怎么做&quot;。这种分离使得底层实现可以独立演进——从 AWS RDS 迁移到 Google Cloud SQL，开发者的声明无需变更。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 开发者视角&#10;        A[我需要一个数据库&lt;br&gt;type: postgresql, size: medium]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 平台抽象层&#10;        B[资源编排器]&#10;        C[策略引擎]&#10;        D[状态管理]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 云提供商&#10;        E[AWS RDS]&#10;        F[GCP Cloud SQL]&#10;        G[Azure Database]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; G\">graph TB\n    subgraph 开发者视角\n        A[我需要一个数据库&lt;br&gt;type: postgresql, size: medium]\n    end\n    subgraph 平台抽象层\n        B[资源编排器]\n        C[策略引擎]\n        D[状态管理]\n    end\n    subgraph 云提供商\n        E[AWS RDS]\n        F[GCP Cloud SQL]\n        G[Azure Database]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无抽象（直接使用云 API）</th>\n<th>Terraform 模块</th>\n<th>Crossplane Composition</th>\n<th>平台 API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽象层次</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>资源级</td>\n<td>资源组合级</td>\n<td>业务语义级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多云支持</td>\n<td>手动适配</td>\n<td>Provider 切换</td>\n<td>原生多云</td>\n<td>平台封装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自助程度</td>\n<td>需运维</td>\n<td>需 PR 审核</td>\n<td>声明式自助</td>\n<td>完全自助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规内置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>模块内嵌</td>\n<td>策略引擎</td>\n<td>平台策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"terraform-抽象层\">Terraform 抽象层</h2><p>Terraform 是最成熟的基础设施即代码（IaC）工具。在平台工程中，Terraform 通过模块化和标准化实现基础设施抽象。平台团队封装底层复杂性为可复用模块，开发者只需调用模块并填写简单参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Terraform 模块抽象层次设计&#10;interface TerraformModuleHierarchy {&#10;  level1_primitive: {&#10;    description: &#39;原子资源模块（1:1 映射云资源）&#39;;&#10;    example: &#39;aws_rds_instance, aws_security_group&#39;;&#10;    maintainer: &#39;平台团队&#39;;&#10;    consumer: &#39;高级工程师、特殊场景&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  level2_composite: {&#10;    description: &#39;组合模块（多个原子资源组合）&#39;;&#10;    example: &#39;database（含 RDS + 安全组 + 参数组 + 备份策略）&#39;;&#10;    maintainer: &#39;平台团队&#39;;&#10;    consumer: &#39;一般开发者&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  level3_application: {&#10;    description: &#39;应用级模块（完整应用基础设施）&#39;;&#10;    example: &#39;microservice（含 ECS/EKS + ALB + RDS + Redis + 监控）&#39;;&#10;    maintainer: &#39;平台团队&#39;;&#10;    consumer: &#39;通过脚手架自动生成&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Terraform 模块抽象层次设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TerraformModuleHierarchy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  level1_primitive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '原子资源模块（1:1 映射云资源）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'aws_rds_instance, aws_security_group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maintainer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '平台团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    consumer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '高级工程师、特殊场景'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  level2_composite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '组合模块（多个原子资源组合）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'database（含 RDS + 安全组 + 参数组 + 备份策略）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maintainer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '平台团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    consumer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '一般开发者'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  level3_application</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '应用级模块（完整应用基础设施）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'microservice（含 ECS/EKS + ALB + RDS + Redis + 监控）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maintainer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '平台团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    consumer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '通过脚手架自动生成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 平台团队提供的标准化 Terraform 模块示例&#10;module &quot;api_database&quot;:&#10;  source: &#39;git::https://platform.internal/modules/database?ref=v2.3.0&#39;&#10;  inputs:&#10;    name: &#39;order-service-db&#39;&#10;    engine: &#39;postgresql&#39;&#10;    engine_version: &#39;15&#39;&#10;    size: &#39;medium&#39;&#10;    environment: &#39;production&#39;&#10;    backup_retention_days: 30&#10;    multi_az: true&#10;&#10;# 平台团队在模块内部处理的复杂性（对开发者透明）&#10;internal_complexity:&#10;  - &#39;VPC 子网选择（基于 environment 自动路由）&#39;&#10;  - &#39;安全组规则（仅允许同 VPC 的应用访问）&#39;&#10;  - &#39;参数组配置（基于 size 自动优化）&#39;&#10;  - &#39;监控告警（CPU &gt; 80%, 连接数 &gt; 90%）&#39;&#10;  - &#39;备份策略（跨区域复制）&#39;&#10;  - &#39;加密配置（KMS 密钥自动创建）&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 平台团队提供的标准化 Terraform 模块示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">module \"api_database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'git::https://platform.internal/modules/database?ref=v2.3.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  inputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service-db'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    engine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'postgresql'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    engine_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'15'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'medium'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    backup_retention_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    multi_az</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 平台团队在模块内部处理的复杂性（对开发者透明）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">internal_complexity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VPC 子网选择（基于 environment 自动路由）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'安全组规则（仅允许同 VPC 的应用访问）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'参数组配置（基于 size 自动优化）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'监控告警（CPU > 80%, 连接数 > 90%）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'备份策略（跨区域复制）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'加密配置（KMS 密钥自动创建）'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Terraform 抽象的局限性在于它仍然是命令式工作流（plan → apply），需要 CI/CD 流水线驱动。对于需要持续调谐（Reconciliation）的场景，Kubernetes 原生的方案更为合适。</p>\n<h2 id=\"crossplane-声明式抽象\">Crossplane 声明式抽象</h2><p>Crossplane 将基础设施管理带入 Kubernetes 的声明式模型中。它以 Kubernetes CRD（Custom Resource Definition）的形式暴露云资源，让基础设施管理与应用管理使用同一套工具链和工作流。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Crossplane CompositeResourceDefinition：定义平台抽象&#10;apiVersion: apiextensions.crossplane.io/v1&#10;kind: CompositeResourceDefinition&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: databases.platform.example.com&#10;spec:&#10;  group: platform.example.com&#10;  names:&#10;    kind: Database&#10;    plural: databases&#10;  versions:&#10;    - name: v1&#10;      served: true&#10;      schema:&#10;        openAPIV3Schema:&#10;          type: object&#10;          properties:&#10;            spec:&#10;              type: object&#10;              properties:&#10;                engine:&#10;                  type: string&#10;                  enum: [&#39;postgresql&#39;, &#39;mysql&#39;]&#10;                size:&#10;                  type: string&#10;                  enum: [&#39;small&#39;, &#39;medium&#39;, &#39;large&#39;]&#10;                environment:&#10;                  ty