-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Platform API（REST/GraphQL）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    experience</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLI 或 SDK 调用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CI/CD 集成、自动化脚本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  declarativeLayer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Kubernetes CRD + Crossplane'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    experience</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'YAML 声明提交到 Git'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GitOps 工作流、高级定制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  directLayer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Terraform CLI / Cloud Console'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    experience</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '直接操作底层资源'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    useCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Escape Hatch、调试、特殊场景'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    governance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '需要额外审批'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>好的抽象设计应该提供多层访问方式：大多数开发者通过 UI 和 API 完成操作（高抽象层），有经验的工程师可以通过声明式 YAML 精细控制（中抽象层），特殊情况下可以直接操作底层资源（低抽象层）。这种分层设计兼顾了易用性和灵活性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((基础设施抽象))&#10;    抽象策略&#10;      资源级抽象&#10;      组合级抽象&#10;      业务语义抽象&#10;    Terraform 方案&#10;      模块层次化&#10;      CI/CD 驱动&#10;      成熟生态&#10;    Crossplane 方案&#10;      Kubernetes 原生&#10;      持续调谐&#10;      CRD 即抽象&#10;    集成层&#10;      Backstage UI&#10;      Platform API&#10;      GitOps 工作流\">mindmap\n  root((基础设施抽象))\n    抽象策略\n      资源级抽象\n      组合级抽象\n      业务语义抽象\n    Terraform 方案\n      模块层次化\n      CI/CD 驱动\n      成熟生态\n    Crossplane 方案\n      Kubernetes 原生\n      持续调谐\n      CRD 即抽象\n    集成层\n      Backstage UI\n      Platform API\n      GitOps 工作流</pre><ul>\n<li>基础设施抽象的核心是关注点分离：开发者描述&quot;要什么&quot;，平台处理&quot;怎么做&quot;</li>\n<li>Terraform 通过三层模块化（原子→组合→应用级）实现渐进式抽象</li>\n<li>Crossplane 将基础设施管理带入 Kubernetes 原生声明式模型，支持持续调谐</li>\n<li>多层访问方式（UI → API → YAML → 直接操作）兼顾易用性和灵活性</li>\n<li>好的抽象让底层实现可以独立演进，开发者声明不变</li>\n<li>Backstage 是基础设施抽象的理想前端，提供可视化的自助体验</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基础设施抽象","id":"基础设施抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Terraform 抽象层","id":"terraform-抽象层"},{"level":2,"text":"Crossplane 声明式抽象","id":"crossplane-声明式抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"Backstage 集成与开发者界面","id":"backstage-集成与开发者界面"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"黄金路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/golden-paths"},"next":{"title":"自助式资源供给","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/self-service-provisioning"}}